<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92220" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥᾰφ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>seam</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμάντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					22.186
				</span></i>
			; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χιτῶνος</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cleom.</u>
				37
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>suture</i> of the skull, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεφαλὴ οὐκ ἔχουσα ῥαφήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					9.83
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VC</u>
				1
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				76a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				491b2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				516a15
			</span></i>; also of the heart and other parts, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>PA</u>
				667a7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				677b19
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥαφαὶ ὀστέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					1159
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.</u>
				503
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>stitching, sewing</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρήσει καὶ ῥαφῇ χρωμένη σύνθεσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Plt.</u>
					280c
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ ῥ. τοῦ τραύματος</span>, of
			a wound <i>that had been sewn up</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				43.11
			</span></i>.</div>
